<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups Glaxo target.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups Glaxo target.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said on Tuesday it raised its price target for drug group Glaxo Wellcome Plc, ahead of expected positive news from a briefing on research prospects to be given in London on Friday and New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Goldman raised its 12-month target on the stock to 12.90 stg from 12.10 stg. The stock remains on its &quot;recommended&quot; list.</p>
<p>Glaxo shares were up 17-1/2p at 11.76 stg by 1343 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
